    "object": {
      "Graph": {
        "@Type": "f8a58466",
        "@Value": {
          "Implementation": {
            "@Type": "3b83b776",
            "@Value": {
              "TextDocument": {
                "@Type": "f3878285",
                "@Value": {
                  "TextBlobForSerialisation": "(string)tail := free;\n\n(* Check if the register is already in the list to avoid duplicates\n   before adding it to the free list. If it is found, exit the method\n   early. Do not signal an error. Double free is harmless. The method\n   behaves idempotently. *)\nWHILE tail <> CONS_NIL DO\n\tIF tail = head THEN\n\t\tRETURN;\n\tEND_IF\n\n\ttail := cdr(tail);\nEND_WHILE\n\ncons(free, head);\nrplaca(head, CONS_NIL);\n",
                  "LineInfoPersistence": "(string)a909be83-774b-48f2-8232-9c6cd3b7bc27_Impl_LineIds"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "Interface": {
            "@Type": "a9ed5b7e",
            "@Value": {
              "TextDocument": {
                "@Type": "f3878285",
                "@Value": {
                  "TextBlobForSerialisation": "(string)(*\n================================================================================\nFunction Block Method : ConsHeap.put\n\nPurpose:\n    Returns a cell to the free list.\n\nApplication:\n    Call to release a cell for future allocation.\n\nOperation:\n    1. Searches the free list for head.\n    2. Returns without change if head is already free.\n    3. Otherwise prepends head to the free list and clears its car.\n\nInputs:\n    head - Register of the cell to return.\n\nOutputs:\n    None.\n\nInOut:\n    None.\n\nReturn Value:\n    None.\n\nAssumptions:\n    - head is a valid heap register.\n\nLimitations:\n    - Does not report an error when head is invalid or already free.\n\nDependencies:\n    - ConsHeap.cons, ConsHeap.cdr, and ConsHeap.rplaca.\n    - CONS_NIL.\n\nExample:\n\n    fbConsHeap.put(head := crCell);\n\nRevision History:\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Date         Version  Author           Description\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    13/11/2026   1.0      CannyIEC         Documented existing behaviour\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n================================================================================\n*)\nMETHOD put\nVAR_INPUT\n\thead : CONS_REG; (* Register of cons cell to be added to the free list *)\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n\ttail : CONS_REG; (* Current register being checked in the free list *)\nEND_VAR\n",
                  "LineInfoPersistence": "(string)a909be83-774b-48f2-8232-9c6cd3b7bc27_Decl_LineIds"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TypeInfos": {
        "3b83b776": "{3b83b776-fb25-43b8-99f2-3c507c9143fc}",
